{"lemma":"תַּחְבֻּלָה","translit":"tachbulâh","pronunciation":"takh-boo-law'","def":"(only in plural) properly, steerage (as a management of ropes), i.e. (figuratively) guidance or (by implication) a plan","kjv":"good advice, (wise) counsels.","occ":[[19,11,14,"Where no counsel"],[19,24,6,"For by wise counsel"],[17,37,12,"by his counsels"],[19,12,5,"the counsels"],[19,20,18,"and with good advice"],[19,1,5,"unto wise counsels"]]}